nodes.body:
Thank you for testing on sm_86 and for the side-by-side with e5m2.

Fixed in 3dcf88e02: the fused-prepare fallback now uses `not current_platform.has_device_capability(89)`, the same check as the byte decode. On sm_80 the condition does not change, so the A100 results in the description still hold.

I updated the description:
- title and claims now say sm_80 and sm_86;
- your sm_86 numbers are cited, with a link to your comment;
- the 128-column / 4-warp launch stays keyed on (8, 0), because it was measured only there. A separate sm_86 sweep can follow if the single-stream gap matters.

